13
00:52:00,000 --> 00:52:06,000
Sarah Michelle Prinze (née Gellar  GHEL-ər; born
April 14, 1977) is an American actress.

14
00:56:00,000 --> 00:56:06,000
She is known for portraying strong female characters in film and television, and
is regarded as a scream queen for her work in the horror genre.

15
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
After being spotted by a talent agent as a child, Gellar
began her career on television at age five.

16
01:04:00,000 --> 01:04:06,000
She obtained her first leading role in the syndicated teen drama series Swans Crossing (1992) and had her breakthrough as
Kendall Hart on the ABC soap opera All My Children (1993–1995), for which she won a Daytime Emmy Award.

17
01:08:00,000 --> 01:08:06,000
She achieved international recognition for her portrayal of Buffy Summers on the WB/UPN supernatural series Buffy
the Vampire Slayer (1997–2003), which earned her a Saturn Award and a nomination for a Golden Globe.

18
01:12:00,000 --> 01:12:06,000
In film, Gellar has played leading and supporting roles in I Know What You Did Last Summer (1997), Scream 2 (1997), Cruel Intentions (1999), Scooby-Doo
(2002), Scooby-Doo 2: Monsters Unleashed (2004), The Grudge (2004), Southland Tales (2006), The Air I Breathe (2007),  and Do Revenge (2022).

19
01:16:00,000 --> 01:16:06,000
Her other television credits include Ringer (2011–2012), The Crazy Ones
(2013–2014), Wolf Pack (2023), and Dexter: Original Sin (2024–2025).

20
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
As a voice actor, Gellar has appeared in the films Happily N'Ever After (2007) and TMNT (2007), the series Robot Chicken (2005–2018), Star
Wars Rebels (2015–2016), and Masters of the Universe: Revelation (2021), and the video game Call of Duty: Black Ops (2011).

21
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
In 2015, she co-founded Foodstirs, an e-commerce baking company.

22
01:28:00,000 --> 01:28:06,000
Her cookbook, Stirring Up Fun with Food, was published in 2017.

23
01:32:00,000 --> 01:32:06,000
The tone is emotional and intense.
